  "knowledge": "Superfan",
  "description": "Identifies fans with exceptional platform value and engagement",
  "definition": "A fan with tierstep \u2265 8, FEI > 0.7, and MV > 200, representing the highest value segment providing substantial financial support while maintaining high engagement."
}

